        <activityName xml:lang="en">Phosphorus, white, liquid, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Phosphorus, white, liquid, at plant
The functional unit is 1 kg of liquid ozone. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process (based only on literature values).;
CAS number: 007723-14-0; 
Formula: P4; 
UUID: 26c2a24f-232a-3451-9163-65f60c135129
Raw materials and chemicals used for production, by-products and waste produced, transport of materials to manufacturing plant, emissions to air, energy demand and an estimation of the infrastructure of the plant.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production from phosphate rock with the aid of the Wöhler process with a yield of 91%.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Process data based on indications in Ullmann's encyclopedia. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_26c2a24f-232a-3451-9163-65f60c135129.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
